follows: 
1. Error code 04096 means that the motor controller has no data to report, indicating bad 
wiring or a missing SN number; 
2. Error code 08192 means that the battery has no data to report, which suggests a 
potential battery problem; 

3. Error code 16384 means that there is wrong with the display sending, indicating an issue 
with the display; 
4. The following error codes can point to problems with the battery or charger: 
(1). Error code 00256 means a charging high-temperature warning; 
(2). Error code 00512 means a charging low-temperature warning; 
(3). Error code 01024 means a discharge high-temperature alarm; 
(4). Error code 02048 means a discharge low-temperature warning;

