5. The following error codes suggest issues with the controller or motor: 
(1). Error code 00016 means an undervoltage fault; 
(2). Error code 00032 means a stall fault; 
(3). Error code 00064 means a sensor failure; 
(4). Error code 00001 means a power tube failure; 
(5). Error code 00002 means an overcurrent fault; 
(6). Error code 00004 means an over-temperature fault; 
(7). Error code 00008 means a hall failure;
